      "chunkIndex": 3,
      "contentPreview": "THREE PARKED FOLLOW-UPS. The SDD ledger lived in .superpowers/ which is gitignored, so they are recorded here or nowhere.  (1) THE PER-ENTRY COMMIT ORDERING HAS NO DISCRIMINATING TEST. The code is correct -- FileMemoryStore.cs\u0027s commit loop is genuinely \u0060File.Move(staged -\u003E final)\u0060 then \u0060WriteSidecar(entry)\u0060 per iteration, confirmed by three independent reads. But nothing pins it: revert the interleave to \u0022rename all, then one PublishIndexUnsafe\u0022 and the suite stays green. I got this wrong TWICE",
